ion-pane kt-accordion-pane-7 kt-pane58_f497e3-f3"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">氯化胆碱有哪些形式？</span></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner"><p class="kt-adv-heading58_6f2bab-2b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading58_6f2bab-2b">我们供应的氯化胆碱有 <strong>粉末</strong>不同的浓度，确保适用于各种饲料应用。</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-8 kt-pane58_adeb5c-98"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">您的产品符合国际质量标准吗？</span></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner"><p class="kt-adv-heading58_fe72d1-8f wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading58_fe72d1-8f">是的。我们的所有产品都符合 <strong>FAMI-QS、GMP+、ISO 和其他国际认证</strong>确保安全、一致和可靠的性能。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column58_ddccbd-1c kb-section-dir-vertical inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="wp-block-kadence-accordion alignnone"><div class="kt-accordion-wrap kt-accordion-id58_601718-82 kt-accordion-has-8-panes kt-active-pane-3 kt-accordion-block kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-left" style="max-width: none;"><div class="kt-accordion-inner-wrap" data-allow-multiple-open="false" data-start-open="3"><div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-4 kt-pane58_f39cbe-2f"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="